Flow:    Login and add to cart
Id:      8f14e45f-ea2b-4c3f-9f1a-77f0d2a3b111
Sizes:   1920x1080 390x844
Description:
  # Logs in to Swag Labs and adds the backpack to the cart.
  #
  # The cart badge shows the count.

Areas:
  <[ Box ]>           on screen   offset -10 20  size 300 200
  <[ Browser ]>       main   window process <[ chrome.exe ]> title contains <[ Swag Labs ]>   scales with dpi   at 120dpi
  <[ Cart badge ]>    inside <[ Browser ]>   ratio 0.88 0.00  size 0.12 0.10
  <[ Game ]>          inside <[ Browser ]>   ratio 0.10 0.20  size 0.80 0.70   scales with area
  <[ Header ]>        inside <[ Browser ]>   offset 0 0  size 1920 90   at 120dpi
  <[ Right screen ]>  monitor <[ \\.\DISPLAY2 ]>   at 96dpi
  <[ Screen ]>        monitor primary

Points:
  <[ Hamburger ]>     inside <[ Browser ]>   ratio 0.95 0.05
  <[ Menu ]>          inside <[ Browser ]>   offset 40 8   at 120dpi
  <[ Origin ]>        on screen   offset 12 -12

Inputs:
  <[ username ]>      default <[ standard_user ]>
  <[ password ]>      secret

Templates:
  <[ template-u9d3n.png ]>    click 60 12   captured 1920x1080 at 120dpi
  <[ template-w2h6r.png ]>    click -4 10   at 96dpi

Steps:

# Everything before the products page.
## Sign in

# A fresh profile every time.
Launch          <[ chrome.exe https://www.saucedemo.com ]>

Find Image      <[ Find username field ]>   template <[ template-u9d3n.png ]> accuracy 0.97 required  template <[ template-w2h6r.png ]> accuracy 0.9   match shape and brightness   in <[ Browser ]>
 Success:
  Move            to <[ Find username field ]>
  Click
  Type            <[ {{username}} ]>
 # The field is behind the menu on a narrow window.
 Failure:
  Move            to point <[ Hamburger ]>
  Click           right double

Wait For Text   <[ Read the total ]>   matches <[ total: (\d+) ]>   in <[ Cart badge ]>   keep <[ (\d+) ]>   timeout 10000ms

Check Value     <[ Order is large ]>   <[ {{Read the total}} ]> > <[ 100 ]>

Wait Until No Text  <[ Banner cleared ]>   is not empty   in <[ Header ]>   no timeout

Check Text      <[ In range ]>   between <[ 1 ]> and <[ 9 ]>   in <[ Header ]>

Move            to point <[ Origin ]>

Drag            at point <[ Hamburger ]> to point <[ Origin ]>

Scroll          down 3

Press           <[ Ctrl+C ]>

Wait            800ms to 1200ms

System          LOCK_WORKSTATION

Resize Window   process <[ chrome.exe ]> title starts with <[ Swag ]>   size 1280 720

Move Window     process <[ chrome.exe ]>   to point <[ Origin ]>

Focus Window    process <[ chrome.exe ]>

Notify          <[ done ]>

Go Back         to <[ Read the total ]>

Loop            5 times
 Move            to <[ Find username field ]>
 Click

End Execution   failed  <[ did not reach the products page ]>
 Run             KILL_PROCESS <[ chrome.exe ]>
